    "identifier": "shikigami-origami-technique-dance-of-the-shikigami",
    "description": "<p>With your mastery of paper, you turn yourself into both an Angel and Demon, otherwise known as a Nephilim, accepting both designs into you. Until this jutsu ends, you gain the following benefits:</p>\n<p>You benefit from both the Angel and Demon Forms of your Origami Angel/Demon state.</p>\n<p>You gain the benefit of all Veil Enhancements you have the Canvas Type for.</p>\n<p>If you only have one Canvas Type, you can select one Canvas Type you don’t have, and can benefit from its initial ability, for the duration.</p>\n<p>Shikigami Hijutsu you cast for the duration, can gain up to 1 more Veil effect, based on Canvas Types you have.</p>",
